      "content": "thanks for the tip about the spider mites. i'll try the water spray tomorrow. the weird thing is, it's not just random spots. it feels almost like they're targeting specific parts of the plant at night. like, i walk in at 6am and new holes just... appeared overnight. could anything else be doing this if it's not mites?",
