      "content": "it's just strange though. i've been working in greenhouses my whole life and this feels different. it's like there's something actively avoiding me or hiding in the shadows. i even checked the soil and the underside of the pots. is there any kind of pest that is specifically nocturnal or just really good at staying completely out of sight?",
